Package: cgjrdata
Title: Data Preparation for the Country Jobs and Growth Report
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ifeanyi", "Edochie", email = "iedochie@worldbank.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Pulls, processes and packages the indicators that make up the
    World Bank Country Jobs and Growth Report (CGJR) analytical framework.
    Every indicator's placement in the taxonomy lives in a single crosswalk
    table (cgjr_crosswalk), annotated and validated against cliaretl's own
    eligibility flags at build time. Provides lazyloaded objects for use by
    the cgjrapp Shiny dashboard: cgjr_taxonomy and the annotated
    cgjr_crosswalk, plus three long tidy tibbles - cgjr_ctf
    (Closeness-to-Frontier values at indicator grain, dynamic and static),
    cgjr_scores (equal-weight rollup scores at subcluster, sub-subcluster,
    cluster and overall grain), and cgjr_raw (raw source values) - cgjr_ctf
    and cgjr_scores carrying unit-level (country / region / income group)
    columns, plus wbcountries (World Bank country classifications).
